---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import MHRafinImage from "../../images/mhrafin.jpg";
---

<section id="home-about-me-section">
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-svh">
    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-0 w-full border-t lg:*:h-96"
    >
      <div
        class="border-b lg:border-y border-stroke-strong text-[clamp(4rem,18vw,17.5rem)] font-black font-display col-span-1 sm:col-span-2 h-40 sm:h-48 flex items-center justify-center"
      >
        ABOU
      </div>
      <div
        class="border border-stroke-strong p-3 sm:p-6 lg:p-12 h-72 sm:h-80 lg:h-96"
      >
        <div class="h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xs relative">
          <Image
            src={MHRafinImage}
            alt="Mahedi Hassan Rafin is sat on a rock near a flowing river in a scenic place."
            class="h-full w-full object-cover object-left scale-125 origin-left"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-brand/80 mix-blend-multiply"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="border-b lg:border-y border-stroke-strong text-[clamp(4rem,18vw,17.5rem)] font-black font-display h-40 sm:h-48 flex items-center justify-center"
      >
        T
      </div>
      <div
        class="border-b border-stroke-strong text-[clamp(4rem,18vw,17.5rem)] font-black font-display h-40 sm:h-48 flex items-center justify-center"
      >
        M
      </div>
      <div
        class="border-b lg:border-l border-stroke-strong text-justify flex items-center p-5 min-h-40 sm:min-h-56"
      >
        I've spent the last year building backend systems that hold up under
        real use. I built 80+ REST API endpoints as the sole backend developer
        on a School Management System, cut API response time from 22 seconds to
        2 by fixing N+1 queries, and patched a security vulnerability affecting
        500+ users. I work mainly with Python, Django REST Framework, FastAPI,
        and PostgreSQL.
      </div>
      <div
        class="border-b lg:border-x border-stroke-strong text-[clamp(4rem,18vw,17.5rem)] font-black font-display h-40 sm:h-48 flex items-center justify-center"
      >
        E
      </div>
      <div
        class="border-b border-stroke-strong text-justify flex items-center p-5 min-h-40 sm:min-h-56"
      >
        Outside of client work, I build things to stay sharp. I've shipped a
        GPT-4o travel planner, a meeting scheduler, and I'm currently exploring
        RAG systems and multi-agent architectures with LangGraph. I care more
        about writing code that's correct and maintainable than code that just
        works today. When I'm not building, I'm usually deepening my Python and
        TypeScript fundamentals or reading about how distributed systems fail.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
